WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
First I install shotfleet with one line.
Then I check the Mac.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
doctor --fix looks for Maestro,
Java, Xcode and the Android SDK.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.700
Sped up 3x here.
Real time: 5 seconds.

4
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.500
If something is missing, it shows me
the plan and asks once.

5
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
On my Mac nothing was missing.
iOS and Android are both ready.

6
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.900
It never uses sudo.
Next step: shotfleet init.
